00:10:00,198 --> 00:10:02,255
the system, and that's unintended

131
00:10:03,255 --> 00:10:05,320
So how do we defend against these?

132
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:11,172
So we'll talk about five defenses
for the model layer The first,

133
00:10:11,516 --> 00:10:13,223
keep instructions and data apart.

134
00:10:14,059 --> 00:10:18,037
Stop concatenating user input in,
into your system prompt string.

135
00:10:18,884 --> 00:10:22,397
Use the structured messages API,
system role for instruction,

136
00:10:22,408 --> 00:10:23,862
