139
00:10:34,059 --> 00:10:35,433
before it drives an action.

140
00:10:36,733 --> 00:10:40,310
In normal software, we validate
everything that comes in from outside.

141
00:10:42,103 --> 00:10:46,517
Model outputs need the same treatment,
especially when it's about to call

142
00:10:46,517 --> 00:10:53,145
a tool, run code, hit an API, or
basically taking any action that can

143
00:10:53,156 --> 00:10:55,894
cause any unintend- unintended reaction.

144
00:10:57,815 --> 00:11:02,302
Third, run a content
classifier on every response.

145
00:11:03,135 --> 00:11:08,657
there are many tools that are available
to do that, and they look for direct

146
00:11:08,657 --> 00:11:10,821
and indirect, injection patterns

147
00:11:11,821 --> 00:11:15,883
Harden the system prompt with explicit
