three threats here, not four.

165
00:12:40,212 --> 00:12:41,967
first is the confused deputy problem.

166
00:12:42,692 --> 00:12:48,231
Your agent acts for user A, which
reads or changes user B's data The

167
00:12:48,231 --> 00:12:52,451
usual cause of such things is either
there is a shared memory or, vector

