175
00:13:14,125 --> 00:13:16,689
The second is excess-
excessive permissions.

176
00:13:17,616 --> 00:13:20,938
The agent has tools and access
it doesn't need for the task.

177
00:13:21,627 --> 00:13:25,774
For example, a search and summarize
agent that can also delete files.

178
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:29,259
search and summarization
agent need not have the…

