00:13:39,789 --> 00:13:43,220
of any failure actually equals
the permissions you have granted.

182
00:13:43,956 --> 00:13:50,737
So keep both of those small Multi-agent
trust chains An orchestrator hand

183
00:13:50,747 --> 00:13:54,629
works with sub-agents, and each one
trusts whatever comes from upstream.

184
00:13:55,982 --> 00:13:59,728
A compromised sub-agent can
send false results back up.

185
00:14:00,803 --> 00:14:05,657
A compromised orchestrator can poison
the whole pipeline The multi-agent

186
00:14:05,662 --> 00:14:10,393
frameworks make this pattern easy to
build, so this attack surface is spreading

187
00:14:11,393 --> 00:14:13,612
So let's look at how we can defend these.

