00:14:15,243 --> 00:14:17,057
So we'll talk about five defenses.

189
00:14:18,704 --> 00:14:20,604
So first is the least privilege.

190
00:14:21,652 --> 00:14:26,802
Give the agent the smallest set of tools
it needs and keep them on an allow list.

191
00:14:27,709 --> 00:14:30,269
Reject anything that is not on the list.

192
00:14:30,917 --> 00:14:33,614
So this alone will
shrink the blast radius.

193
00:14:33,664 --> 00:14:35,861
you only give the tools it needs.

194
00:14:37,629 --> 00:14:40,285
The second, a human-in-loop for agents…

195
00:14:40,584 --> 00:14:42,277
sorry, actions you can't undo.

196
00:14:43,277 --> 00:14:45,832
Sort actions by how reversible they are.

197
00:14:46,257 --> 00:14:51,793
for example, if you're searching something
or summarizing something, it's fine,

198
00:14:52,033 --> 00:14:57,444
But if, this task requires sending
an email or deleting something, then

199
00:14:57,447 --> 00:14:59,747
someone checks it before it, it happens.

