203
00:15:14,719 --> 00:15:17,223
Third is isolate context per user.

204
00:15:17,834 --> 00:15:21,943
If you use a shared vector store
or agent memory, namespace it per

205
00:15:21,943 --> 00:15:27,209
user This is the main fix for the
confused deputy problem, and you need

