00:15:30,732 --> 00:15:34,586
Four, log every action before it happens.

208
00:15:35,108 --> 00:15:40,812
So tool name, arguments, user, timestamp,
and results Logging means that you can

209
00:15:40,867 --> 00:15:43,657
