213
00:15:55,875 --> 00:15:58,795
Sub-agents shouldn't trust
the orchestrator blindly.

214
00:15:59,657 --> 00:16:04,557
It adds a little overhead, but it
stops one compromised agent from

215
00:16:04,557 --> 00:16:10,117
